{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' answer/audit_findings.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- `G-001` should be preserved as approved for `$980.00`; garden supplies are eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and the expense is documented in `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-003` should be preserved as approved for `$420.00`; accessibility printing is eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and the expense is documented in `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-004` should be preserved as rejected for `$0.00`; staff gifts are not eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and the expense is documented in `04_expenses.csv`.\n- The prior outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed should be preserved; they are supported by `05_outcomes.md`.\n\n## Corrections Required\n\n- The prior draft used the stale `$2,000.00` cap from `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`. That must be corrected to `$1,600.00` based on `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- `G-002` should be corrected from full approval of `$145.00` to partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00` in `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- `G-005` should be corrected from approval of `$310.00` to rejection of `$0.00`. `04_expenses.csv` classifies it as `public outreach printing`, which is not listed as eligible in `01_allowability_rules.md`; it also exceeds `$75.00` without a receipt, which independently blocks reimbursement.\n- The prior summary remaining amount under cap of `$145.00` must be corrected because it was calculated from the stale cap and the incorrect expense approvals.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- The prior draft omitted `G-006` Final report postage from `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-006` should be approved for `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. `04_expenses.csv` includes the note `postal ledger entry under receipt threshold`.\n\n## Controlling Award Cap Source\n\n- The controlling award cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- Reason: `01_allowability_rules.md` says to use the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` expressly says it supersedes the original cap in `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Corrected Expense Decisions\n\n| Expense ID | Requested amount | Approved amount | Decision | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n| G-001 | 980.00 | 980.00 | approve | Garden supplies are eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and `04_expenses.csv` shows a receipt on file. |\n| G-002 | 145.00 | 120.00 | partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the `$120.00` event cap in `01_allowability_rules.md`; the excess `$25.00` is not reimbursable. |\n| G-003 | 420.00 | 420.00 | approve | Accessibility printing is eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`, and `04_expenses.csv` shows a receipt on file. |\n| G-004 | 160.00 | 0.00 | reject | Staff gifts are not eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`. |\n| G-005 | 310.00 | 0.00 | reject | `04_expenses.csv` lists this as public outreach printing, which is not an eligible category in `01_allowability_rules.md`. It also exceeds `$75.00` without a receipt, so the receipt rule would independently bar reimbursement. |\n| G-006 | 68.00 | 68.00 | approve | Public outreach postage is eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md`. Because the amount is `$75.00` or less and `04_expenses.csv` includes a ledger note, it can be approved without a receipt under the receipt rule. |\n\nCorrected reimbursable total: `$1,588.00`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
